# `restart-notify` to its first restart's passes, then a pass a day later: the entry the load brought back while its
# notification was in progress stays in memory until the day-old REMOVED rule frees it.
database real
rules tests/corpus/notify/plain.conf
chart loop.n loop.n_name loop.notify disks things 1
label loop.n kind ssd
var loop.n v 10
clock 0
pass 0
var loop.n v 70
clock 1
pass 1
clock 2
pass 2
clock 100
restart
clock 101
pass 101
clock 102
pass 102
clock 86502
pass 86502
clock 86503
alarm-log 0
